# U42: open allflame_exp_001 from the build list (RETURN on the selected row), Ctrl+5 (CONFIG):
# ConfigTab:Draw lays the sections out in columns (the section `col` hints, the shortest column
# otherwise), fills the config set selector (SetList) and sizes the scroll bar. Then the mouse
# wheel scrolls the tab (Draw's KeyUp loop: scrollBar:Scroll) and back. At the end ConfigVisibility
# (isRelevantForBuild over the mainEnv used-tables the bridge brings, isShowAllExcluded) runs on
# both sides for every option and must agree.
#! u42-visibility
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
move 400 91
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
key-down CTRL
press 5
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 900 500
wheel down 3
frames 3
wheel down 20
frames 3
wheel up 30
frames 3
